&lt;li&gt;CMS IOM Publication 100-08, &lt;em&gt;Medicare Program Integrity Manual&lt;&sol;em&gt;,
&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type: circle;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chapter 13, Section 13.5.4 Reasonable and Necessary Provision in an LCD&lt;&sol;li&gt;
