&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 121%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 121%;&quot;&gt;*Note: Any additional definitive UDT beyond recommendations above must be justified by the clinician in the medical situations in which changes in prescribed medications may be needed, such as:&lt;&sol;span&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 121%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 121%;&quot;&gt; &lt;&sol;span&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
