&lt;li&gt;42 CFR, Chapter IV, Subchapter G, Part 494, Subpart C,
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Section 494.80 Condition: Patient assessment.&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Section 494.90 Condition: Patient plan of care.&lt;&sol;li&gt;
