&lt;p&gt;CMS Internet-Only Manuals, Pub 100-02, Medicare Benefit Policy Manual, Chapter 15, &amp;#167;80.1.2 A&sol;B MAC (B) Contacts With Independent Clinical Laboratories.&lt;&sol;p&gt;
