&lt;ul&gt;40.10 Drugs and Biologicals [Coverage of Comprehensive Outpatient Rehabilitation Facility services]&lt;&sol;ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CMS Publication 100-02, &lt;em&gt;Medicare Benefit Policy Manual,&lt;&sol;em&gt; Chapter 15:&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;50.1&amp;#8211;50.5 Drugs and Biologicals 120 Ambulatory Surgical Center Services&lt;&sol;ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CMS Publication 100-02, &lt;em&gt;Medicare Benefit Policy Manual,&lt;&sol;em&gt; Chapter 16:&lt;&sol;p&gt;
