&lt;p&gt;CMS Publication 100-04; &lt;em&gt;Medicare Claims Processing Manual,&lt;&sol;em&gt; Chapter 17:&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;40 Discarded Drugs and Biologicals&lt;&sol;ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CMS Publication 100-04; &lt;em&gt;Medicare Claims Processing Manual,&lt;&sol;em&gt; Chapter 30:&lt;&sol;p&gt;
