&lt;p&gt;42 CFR 410.73 &amp;#8211; 410.76 describes coverage of services provided by clinical social workers, physician assistants, nurse practitioners, or clinical nurse specialists.&lt;br &sol;&gt;&lt;br &sol;&gt;CMS Publication 100-02: &lt;em&gt;Medicare Benefit Policy Manual&lt;&sol;em&gt;, Chapter 15 &amp;#8211; Covered Medical and Other Health Services:&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 30px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#167;160 Clinical Psychologist Services&amp;#160;&lt;br &sol;&gt;&amp;#167;170 Clinical Social Worker (CSW) Services&amp;#160;&lt;br &sol;&gt;&amp;#167;180 Nurse-Midwife (CNM) Services&amp;#160;&lt;br &sol;&gt;&amp;#167;190 Physician Assistant (PA) Services&amp;#160;&lt;br &sol;&gt;&amp;#167;200 Nurse Practitioner (NP) Services&amp;#160;&lt;br &sol;&gt;&amp;#167;210 Clinical Nurse Specialist (CNS) Services&lt;br &sol;&gt;&amp;#167;330 Marriage and Family Therapist (MFT) Services&lt;br &sol;&gt;&amp;#167;340 Mental Health Counselor (MHC) Services&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CMS Publication 100-03: &lt;em&gt;Medicare National Coverage Determinations (NCD) Manual,&lt;&sol;em&gt; Chapter 1 &amp;#8211; Coverage Determinations, Part 1:&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 30px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#167;30.1 Biofeedback Therapy&lt;&sol;p&gt;
