&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;42 CFR &amp;sect;410.32(a) Diagnostic x-ray tests, diagnostic laboratory tests, and other diagnostic tests: Conditions&lt;&sol;span&gt;&lt;&sol;span&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
