indication:
&lt;p&gt;Molecular diagnostic tests used to assist in risk stratification of melanoma patients are covered when ALL of the following are true:&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The patient has a personal history of melanoma AND:&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;&sol;ol&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;list-style-type: none;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol style=&quot;list-style-type: lower-alpha;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Either
&lt;ol style=&quot;list-style-type: lower-roman;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has Stage T1b and above OR&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has T1a with documented concern about adequacy of microstaging&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;&sol;ol&gt;
&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is undergoing workup or being evaluated for treatment, AND&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Does not have metastatic disease AND&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Presumed risk for a positive Sentinel Lymph Node Biopsy (SLNB) based on clinical, histological, or other information is &amp;gt;5% AND&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a disease stage, grade, and Breslow thickness (or other qualifying conditions) within the intended use of the test&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;&sol;ol&gt;
&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;&sol;ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;2. The TEST has demonstrated, as part of a Technical Assessment:&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;&sol;span&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;list-style-type: none;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol style=&quot;list-style-type: lower-alpha;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clinical validity of analytes tested in predicting metastatic disease ( or absence of metastice disease) in peer-reviewed scientific literature&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utility beyond clinical, histological, and radiographical factors in the ability to accurately stratify patients into risk groups to manage patient care, such by precluding unnecessary sentinel lymph node biopsies&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appropriate analytical validity&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance characteristics equivalent or superior to other covered, similar tests&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;&sol;ol&gt;
&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;&sol;ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;&sol;p&gt;

