&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chapter 15, Section 80.1 Clinical Laboratory Services, Section 80.1.1 Certification Changes, Section 80.1.2 A&sol;B MAC (B) Contacts With Independent Clinical Laboratories, Section 80.1.3 Independent Laboratory Service to a Patient in the Patient&amp;rsquo;s Home or an Institution, Section 80.6 Requirements for Ordering and Following Orders for Diagnostic Tests, Section 80.6.1 Definitions, and Section 280 Preventive and Screening Services&lt;&sol;li&gt;
