&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chapter 1, Part 2, Section 90.1 Pharmacogenomic Testing to Predict Warfarin Responsiveness and Section 90.2 Next Generation Sequencing for Patients with Advanced Cancer&lt;&sol;li&gt;
