&lt;li&gt;A trial of at least 1 therapeutic intra-articular SIJ injection (i.e., corticosteroid injection that results in a &amp;ge;50% reduction of pain for the expected duration of the injected agent &lt;strong&gt;AND&lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;li&gt;
