&lt;li&gt;The patient has acute or stable chest pain with no known CAD&lt;sup&gt;1&lt;&sol;sup&gt; and is eligible for CCTA*, &lt;strong&gt;AND &lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;li&gt;
