&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;Title XVIII of the Social Security Act, &amp;sect;1862(a)(7) excludes routine physical examinations&lt;&sol;span&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;42 CFR &amp;sect;409.32 Criteria for skilled services and the need for skilled services&lt;&sol;span&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;42 CFR &amp;sect;410.32(b)(3) Diagnostic x-ray tests, diagnostic laboratory tests, and other diagnostic tests: Conditions&lt;&sol;span&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;42 CFR &amp;sect;410.61 Plan of treatment requirements for outpatient rehabilitation services &lt;&sol;span&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
