&lt;p&gt;&lt;br &sol;&gt;For the items addressed in this LCD, the &quot;reasonable and necessary&quot; criteria, based on Social Security Act &amp;sect; 1862(a)(1)(A) provisions, are defined by the following coverage indications, limitations and&sol;or medical necessity.&lt;br &sol;&gt;&lt;br &sol;&gt;For spinal orthoses definitions of Off-The-Shelf (OTS), custom fitted and custom fabricated, refer to the CODING GUIDELINES section in the LCD-related Policy Article.&lt;br &sol;&gt;&lt;br &sol;&gt;A spinal orthosis (L0450, L0452, L0454, L0455, L0456, L0457, L0458, L0460, L0462, L0464, L0466, L0467, L0468, L0469, L0470, L0472, L0480, L0482, L0484, L0486, L0488, L0490, L0491, L0492, L0621, L0622, L0623, L0624, L0625, L0626, L0627, L0628, L0629, L0630, L0631, L0632, L0633, L0634, L0635, L0636, L0637, L0638, L0639, L0640, L0641, L0642, L0643, L0648, L0649, L0650, L0651) is covered when it is ordered for one of the following indications:&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;ol type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To reduce pain by restricting mobility of the trunk; or&lt;br &sol;&gt;&lt;br &sol;&gt;&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To facilitate healing following an injury to the spine or related soft tissues; or&lt;br &sol;&gt;&lt;br &sol;&gt;&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To facilitate healing following a surgical procedure on the spine or related soft tissue; or&lt;br &sol;&gt;&lt;br &sol;&gt;&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To otherwise support weak spinal muscles and&sol;or a deformed spine.&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;&sol;ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If a spinal orthosis is provided and the coverage criteria are not met, the item will be denied as not medically necessary.&lt;br &sol;&gt;&lt;br &sol;&gt;GENERAL&lt;&sol;p&gt;
